<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BT ups Newcrest stake to 8.43 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BT ups Newcrest stake to 8.43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust Australia Ltd has increased its stake in gold miner Newcrest Mining Ltd to 8.43 percent from 7.13 percent.</p>
<p>Bankers Trust said in a notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that it had 19.96 million Newcrest shares.</p>
<p>The Newcrest stake is valued at A$85.83 million based on Newscrest's closing market price of A$4.30, a 12 cent rise on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
